sentences.text:
1 the petitioners immediately, without any further delay, the amount of compensation along with 100% Solatium and upto date interest as provided in the Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013 (here- in after to be referred as "the Act") for their lands treating them as residential which have/has been acquired for construction of Patna Gaya Dovi N. H. 83 Four Lane Road;
(ii) for issuance of an appropriate writ directing and commanding the respondents to pay the petitioners interest as provided under the provisions of the aforesaid Act,
2013 as well as the penal interest for the period the amount compensation for the land of the petitioners, have not been paid or is not paid to the petitioners.

